&lt;li&gt;Public safety and emergency experience (First Aid/CPR training)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Windows based operating systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Microsoft Office (Excel, PowerPoint, Word, Outlook)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with video management, access control, incident reporting, visitor management, and other security system software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge and experience with installing and maintaining security systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability to work any schedule needed, to include: nights, weekends and rotating shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to occasionally stand in a static position for extended periods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to work extended hours&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must possess or be eligible to obtain and maintain a TS/SCI Security Clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift or carry up to forty pounds of equipment or gear unassisted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to pass Air Force and NASA background checks for installation access as directed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively execute duties in extreme outdoor environments – heat, cold, rain, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position is subject to pre-employment enhanced screening, including a background check, psychological test, bi-annual physical fitness test, and a drug and alcohol test&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position is subject to random drug and alcohol testing&lt;/li&gt;
