&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Services Manager&lt;/strong&gt;– Assistive Care in Tinton Falls, NJ&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt;: $50,000- $55,000 per year plus commission&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PTO, comprehensive benefits, 401k match&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA HOME HEALTH CARE&lt;/strong&gt; is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;full-time Client Services Manager&lt;/strong&gt; for our &lt;strong&gt;Assistive Care&lt;/strong&gt; office in &lt;strong&gt;Tinton Falls, NJ&lt;/strong&gt;. This office provides &lt;strong&gt;best-in-class non-medical home care&lt;/strong&gt; to adults and seniors, helping them live safely at home with &lt;strong&gt;comfort, dignity, and independence&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;If you are looking for an exciting career opportunity in a growing industry, a &lt;strong&gt;Client Services Manager&lt;/strong&gt; role could be the right next step for you. BAYADA believes that our clients and their families deserve home care delivered with &lt;strong&gt;compassion, excellence, and reliability&lt;/strong&gt;, and we are looking for a leader who shares those values.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;_9k2iva0 p8i6j0c _1ibi0s314 heading3 _9k2iva1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;_9k2iva0 p8i6j0c _1ibi0s314 heading3 _9k2iva1&quot;&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;Client Services Manager (CSM), you are the central coordinator of care in the office. You will:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p8i6j07 p8i6j02&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Ensure that clients receive &lt;strong&gt;consistent, high-quality services&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Support and engage our &lt;strong&gt;home health aides and caregivers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Partner closely with the &lt;strong&gt;clinical manager and director&lt;/strong&gt; to grow and sustain a healthy caseload&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Help BAYADA reach more people who want to remain safely at home through&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;assistive care services&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;tk0j8o1 _1ibi0s31a _1ibi0s3do&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:rrh:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3dd _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://bayadahomehc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/jportillo_bayada_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B1E92D180-D765-48EE-8D96-A043A09BD880%7D&amp;amp;file=Client%20Services%20Manager%20Script.docx&amp;amp;action=default&amp;amp;mobileredirect=true&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;3&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:rrk:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3dd _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://acplaybook.bayada.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;4&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;_9k2iva0 p8i6j0c _1ibi0s314 heading3 _9k2iva1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities for a Client Services Manager – Assistive Care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client &amp;amp; caregiver coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p8i6j07 p8i6j02&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Manage a &lt;strong&gt;caseload of Assistive Care clients&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring schedules are filled and services are delivered reliably&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Coordinate day-to-day &lt;strong&gt;staffing and scheduling&lt;/strong&gt; for personal care and companion services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Communicate regularly with &lt;strong&gt;clients, families, and caregivers&lt;/strong&gt; to understand needs, resolve issues, and maintain a high-quality experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Monitor and respond to &lt;strong&gt;open shifts, cancellations, and coverage gaps&lt;/strong&gt; to prevent service interruptions
&lt;div class=&quot;tk0j8o1 _1ibi0s31a _1ibi0s3do&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:rrp:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3dd _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://bayadahomehc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/jportillo_bayada_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B1E92D180-D765-48EE-8D96-A043A09BD880%7D&amp;amp;file=Client%20Services%20Manager%20Script.docx&amp;amp;action=default&amp;amp;mobileredirect=true&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;3&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:rrt:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3dd _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://acplaybook.bayada.com/client-services-manager-csm-development/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;5&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Referral management &amp;amp; growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p8i6j07 p8i6j02&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Receive and process &lt;strong&gt;referrals&lt;/strong&gt; from hospitals, discharge planners, payors, and community partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Partner with clinical team and director to &lt;strong&gt;convert referrals to active cases&lt;/strong&gt; quickly and smoothly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Track &lt;strong&gt;billable hours and caseload growth&lt;/strong&gt;, contributing to office productivity and financial health
&lt;div class=&quot;tk0j8o1 _1ibi0s31a _1ibi0s3do&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:rs2:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3dd _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://bayadahomehc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/jportillo_bayada_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B1E92D180-D765-48EE-8D96-A043A09BD880%7D&amp;amp;file=Client%20Services%20Manager%20Script.docx&amp;amp;action=default&amp;amp;mobileredirect=true&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;3&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field staff support &amp;amp; engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p8i6j07 p8i6j02&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Build strong, trusting relationships with &lt;strong&gt;home health aides and caregivers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Support caregivers with &lt;strong&gt;schedule changes, questions, and concerns&lt;/strong&gt;, escalating issues appropriately&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Collaborate with recruiting and clinical leaders around &lt;strong&gt;onboarding, compliance, and performance&lt;/strong&gt; of field staff
&lt;div class=&quot;tk0j8o1 _1ibi0s31a _1ibi0s3do&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:rs6:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3dd _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://acplaybook.bayada.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;4&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:rsa:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3dd _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://acspplaybook.bayada.com/recruiting-philosophy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;6&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office teamwork &amp;amp; operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p8i6j07 p8i6j02&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Collaborate daily with the &lt;strong&gt;director, clinical manager, and office team&lt;/strong&gt; to achieve goals in client satisfaction, staffing, and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Use BAYADA systems (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;scheduling and documentation platforms, Workday, email, and reports&lt;/strong&gt;) to manage caseload and workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Model &lt;strong&gt;The BAYADA Way&lt;/strong&gt;—our core values of &lt;em&gt;compassion, excellence, and reliability&lt;/em&gt;—in all interactions
&lt;div class=&quot;tk0j8o1 _1ibi0s31a _1ibi0s3do&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:rsf:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3dd _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://bayadahomehc.sharepoint.com/sites/PublishedPolicyFileTeam/Shared%20Documents/Published%20Policy%20Files/Published/Job%20Descriptions/0-10925%20-%20DIVISIONAL%20CLIENT%20SERVICES%20MANAGER%20-%20ASSISTIVE%20CARE.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;7&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:rsi:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3dd _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://bayadahomehc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/jportillo_bayada_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B1E92D180-D765-48EE-8D96-A043A09BD880%7D&amp;amp;file=Client%20Services%20Manager%20Script.docx&amp;amp;action=default&amp;amp;mobileredirect=true&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;3&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;_9k2iva0 p8i6j0c _1ibi0s314 heading3 _9k2iva1&quot;&gt;Qualifications for a Client Services Manager – Assistive Care&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p8i6j07 p8i6j02&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in customer service, staffing, scheduling, or coordination in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;relationship-building and communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Proven ability to &lt;strong&gt;prioritize, stay organized, and manage competing deadlines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Comfort using computers and learning new systems (scheduling, documentation, reporting)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Alignment with &lt;strong&gt;The BAYADA Way&lt;/strong&gt; and a genuine desire to support clients, families, and caregivers
&lt;div class=&quot;tk0j8o1 _1ibi0s31a _1ibi0s3do&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:rsn:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3dd _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://bayadahomehc.sharepoint.com/sites/PublishedPolicyFileTeam/Shared%20Documents/Published%20Policy%20Files/Published/Job%20Descriptions/0-10925%20-%20DIVISIONAL%20CLIENT%20SERVICES%20MANAGER%20-%20ASSISTIVE%20CARE.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;7&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:rsr:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3dd _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://bayadahomehc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/jportillo_bayada_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B1E92D180-D765-48EE-8D96-A043A09BD880%7D&amp;amp;file=Client%20Services%20Manager%20Script.docx&amp;amp;action=default&amp;amp;mobileredirect=true&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;3&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p8i6j07 p8i6j02&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;home care, healthcare, senior services, or human services&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Prior experience with &lt;strong&gt;scheduling / staffing&lt;/strong&gt; or case management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Familiarity with the &lt;strong&gt;local community and service area&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule &amp;amp; Work Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-time role:&lt;/strong&gt; exempt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monday–Friday,&lt;/strong&gt; daytime office hours 8:30am- 5:00pm&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care offers a comprehensive benefits plan including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, and vision coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid holidays, vacation, and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-paid life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about BAYADA benefits:&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bayada.com/benefits&quot;&gt; https://www.bayada.com/benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_1k6fhhvc _1ibi0s3dz&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;_9k2iva0 p8i6j0c _1ibi0s314 heading3 _9k2iva1&quot;&gt;Join BAYADA&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;At BAYADA HOME HEALTH CARE, every role is connected to our vision of &lt;strong&gt;helping millions of people worldwide experience a better quality of life at home&lt;/strong&gt;. As a &lt;strong&gt;Client Services Manager&lt;/strong&gt; in our Assistive Care practice, you’ll grow your skills, your career, and your impact—while being part of a team that truly cares for you so that you can care for others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;tk0j8o1 _1ibi0s31a _1ibi0s3do&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:rsv:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3dd _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://bayadahomehc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/jportillo_bayada_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B1E92D180-D765-48EE-8D96-A043A09BD880%7D&amp;amp;file=Client%20Services%20Manager%20Script.docx&amp;amp;action=default&amp;amp;mobileredirect=true&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;3&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:rt3:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3dd _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://bayadahomehc-my.sharepoint.com/personal/jportillo_bayada_com/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7B781E1557-F027-4FE3-BE38-FDBB3149E852%7D&amp;amp;file=Book1.xlsx&amp;amp;action=default&amp;amp;mobileredirect=true&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;8&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;If you’re energized by &lt;strong&gt;serving others, solving problems, and building meaningful relationships&lt;/strong&gt;, we would be honored to have you apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to make a difference? Apply today to join BAYADA as a Client Services Manager – Assistive Care.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
