&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a technically adept and hands-on Senior Cryogenic Engineer to lead and support&amp;nbsp;the installation, integration, commissioning, and operation of multiple helium cryoplants and&amp;nbsp;associated cryogenic systems—particularly in support of quantum computing applications. The&lt;br&gt;ideal candidate will possess a unique combination of strategic program and project management&amp;nbsp;expertise, exceptional troubleshooting abilities, and deep technical knowledge in vacuum systems&amp;nbsp;and helium cryogenics. Proven experience with process instrumentation and control systems is&amp;nbsp;essential. This role requires excellence in both field execution and system-level design leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Coordinate and supervise the installation, commissioning, and operation of two helium cryoplants and related infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Optimize helium process and system control strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Integrate cryoplants with cryogenic distribution systems and cryostats used in quantum computing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Provide expert-level troubleshooting of cryogenic systems, including instrumentation faults, vacuum failures, and control logic anomalies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Lead the commissioning of cryoplants and cryostats, including system calibration, leak checking, and vacuum pumping procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Lead and manage operational teams, including training and guiding operators during startup, maintenance, and fault recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Develop maintenance strategies for cryoplants and support equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Participate in FATs and SATs, and lead the commissioning of process automation and control systems, including sensor validation and PLC tuning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Spearhead the development and review of P&amp;amp;IDs, and participate in operability and HAZOP reviews for safety and performance assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Maintain high-performance vacuum systems, identify and repair leaks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience/Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;M.Sc. in Mechanical, Electrical, or Chemical Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience with cryogenic systems, including helium refrigeration, LNG, superconducting magnets, or similar technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Proven ability to troubleshoot complex cryogenic and process systems, including instrumentation, vacuum integrity, and control issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Strong working knowledge of PLC-based industrial control systems and process instrumentation (pressure, flow, temperature, vacuum sensors).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Ability to provide technical leadership and resolve issues in high-pressure, ambiguous situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Familiarity with design and implementation of control/instrumentation systems for industrial or scientific facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
